/* 设置 — 说明文字 */
"A menu-bar app normally has no Dock icon. These make it findable there — permanently, or only just after it opens." = "菜单栏应用通常没有程序坞图标。这些选项让它能在那里被找到——永久显示，或仅在启动后短暂显示。";
"Allows applying modes outside the safe-mode flag set — experimental." = "允许应用安全模式标记集之外的模式——实验性。";
"Allows turning a display fully black." = "允许将显示器完全调暗至全黑。";
"Apple Silicon; experimental — screen goes dark while the external is connected." = "Apple 芯片；实验性——外接显示器连接期间屏幕会变黑。";
"Below this point on the combined scale, extra software dimming is applied." = "在组合刻度的此点以下，会额外应用软件调暗。";
"Brief Dock icon at launch" = "启动时短暂显示程序坞图标";
"Brightness the display is reduced to while locked." = "锁定时显示器降低到的亮度。";
"Compresses the usable software range so 0% is not absolute black." = "压缩可用的软件范围，使 0% 不是绝对黑色。";
"Disconnecting a display turns it off until it is re-enabled. The built-in display is never disconnected on Macs where it may not come back without a reboot." = "断开显示器会将其关闭，直至重新启用。在不重新启动就可能无法恢复的 Mac 上，内建显示器永远不会被断开。";
"Display groups let one operation affect several displays: brightness synchronisation, UI scale matching and layout management." = "显示器组可让一次操作影响多台显示器：亮度同步、界面缩放匹配和布局管理。";
"Entitlement-gated on macOS 26+; has no effect there." = "在 macOS 26 及更高版本上受权限限制；在那里不起作用。";
"Experimental direct color-table method" = "实验性的直接色表方法";
"Hiding takes effect only while Show FBD in the Dock is on (see the OSD section): a menu-bar app with no icon and no Dock icon would have nothing left to click, so the preference is ignored until then." = "仅在开启“在程序坞中显示 FBD”时隐藏才会生效（见 OSD 部分）：既无菜单栏图标又无程序坞图标的菜单栏应用将没有任何可点之处，因此在此之前该偏好会被忽略。";
"Hold ⇧ Shift while launching, or set FBD_SAFE_MODE=1, to skip applying stored configuration for one session — the escape hatch after a bad EDID override." = "启动时按住 ⇧ Shift，或设置 FBD_SAFE_MODE=1，可在本次运行中跳过应用已存储的配置——EDID 覆盖出错后的应急出口。";
"Holds a power assertion while FBD runs, so the display stays on through a long transfer, render or presentation. It ends when FBD quits — the assertion belongs to this process, which is why there is no command-line switch for it." = "FBD 运行期间保持电源断言，使显示器在长时间的传输、渲染或演示过程中保持开启。退出 FBD 时即结束——该断言属于此进程，因此没有对应的命令行开关。";
"Keys adjust every connected display that has brightness or volume control." = "按键调整所有支持亮度或音量控制的已连接显示器。";
"Keys adjust the display showing the focused window." = "按键调整显示聚焦窗口的显示器。";
"Keys adjust the display under the pointer." = "按键调整指针所在的显示器。";
"Keys adjust the display whose name matches the current audio device, falling back to the display under the pointer." = "按键调整名称与当前音频设备匹配的显示器，若无则使用指针所在的显示器。";
"Minimum delay between consecutive DDC/CI writes per display." = "每台显示器连续 DDC/CI 写入之间的最短延迟。";
"Off by default: FBD only takes the F1/F2 and F10–F12 keys when you opt in. Requires Accessibility permission, and only affects keys while FBD is running." = "默认关闭：只有在您选择启用后，FBD 才会接管 F1/F2 和 F10–F12 键。需要辅助功能权限，且仅在 FBD 运行时影响这些按键。";
"Peak HDR brightness." = "HDR 峰值亮度。";
"Peak SDR brightness in HDR mode." = "HDR 模式下的 SDR 峰值亮度。";
"Peak brightness in nits when the hardware control is at its maximum." = "硬件控制处于最大值时的峰值亮度（尼特）。";
"Peak brightness in nits when the hardware control is at its minimum." = "硬件控制处于最小值时的峰值亮度（尼特）。";
"Propagate the first connected member's current brightness to the rest of the group." = "将首个已连接成员当前的亮度传播到组内其余显示器。";
"Re-applies a saved custom EDID whenever the display connects." = "每当显示器连接时重新应用已存储的自定义 EDID。";
"Re-applies the saved arrangement when the display layout changes." = "显示器布局变化时重新应用已存储的排列。";
"Re-applies the selected properties when this display reconnects. Properties this display cannot report are unavailable." = "此显示器重新连接时重新应用所选的属性。此显示器无法报告的属性不可用。";
"Record the current display mode into a slot and recall it later." = "将当前显示模式记录到某个槽位，以便稍后调回。";
"Reverts any active EDID override when FBD quits." = "退出 FBD 时还原任何生效中的 EDID 覆盖。";
"Right-click the status item for Show FBD, Settings…, Check for Updates… and Quit." = "右键点按菜单栏图标可显示 FBD、打开“设置…”、“检查更新…”和“退出”。";
"Saves each display's selected properties and re-applies them when the display reconnects. Choose the properties per display under Displays." = "存储每台显示器所选的属性，并在其重新连接时重新应用。请在“显示器”中为每台显示器选择属性。";
"Screen brightness is lowered while the screen is locked or the screensaver is up, and restored on unlock." = "屏幕锁定或屏幕保护程序运行时会降低屏幕亮度，解锁后恢复。";
"Serves the control API on 127.0.0.1. Applies immediately." = "在 127.0.0.1 上提供控制 API。立即生效。";
"Shows a brightness HUD when the display brightness changes." = "显示器亮度变化时显示亮度 HUD。";
"Shows displays the app has seen before even while they are disconnected." = "即使已断开，也显示应用此前见过的显示器。";
"The group is active only while every member is connected." = "仅当所有成员都已连接时该组才生效。";
"The group is active while at least one member is connected." = "至少有一个成员已连接时该组即生效。";
"The group is active while at least two members are connected." = "至少有两个成员已连接时该组即生效。";
"The group is active while both a sync source and a sync target are connected." = "同步源和同步目标都已连接时该组即生效。";
"The group is always active." = "该组始终生效。";
"The lowest hardware brightness value before software dimming takes over." = "软件调暗接管前的最低硬件亮度值。";
"The panel shows one row per display, with brightness, filters, resolutions and XDR/HDR controls, and a footer for Virtual Screens, Groups, PiP, updates and quit." = "面板为每台显示器显示一行，包含亮度、滤镜、分辨率和 XDR/HDR 控制，底部还有虚拟屏幕、显示器组、画中画、更新和退出的入口。";
"The system appearance — the switch Control Center flips, so another app can change it too." = "系统外观——与控制中心所切换的是同一个开关，因此其他应用也能更改它。";
"The top of the XDR/HDR upscaling range on the combined scale." = "组合刻度上 XDR/HDR 升频范围的上限。";
"This Mac (base M3) may not reconnect its built-in display without a reboot." = "此 Mac（基础款 M3）可能无法在不重新启动的情况下重新连接其内建显示器。";
"Used when native XDR upscaling is unavailable. Requires Screen Recording permission." = "在原生 XDR 升频不可用时使用。需要屏幕录制权限。";
"When off, brightness is reached through software dimming rather than the display's own backlight." = "关闭时，亮度通过软件调暗而非显示器自身的背光来实现。";
"When off, group operations are skipped entirely for this group." = "关闭时，此组将完全跳过所有组操作。";
"Whether stored control values are assumed valid, written to the device, or read back at startup." = "启动时对已存储的控制值是假定有效、写入设备，还是回读设备。";

